        "id": "sylvanas",
        "name": "Sylvanas"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Chastise is not that easy to land, therefore Heroes with reliable crowd control can help Anduin with doing so. For this reason, you should draft Anduin together with a Tank with a Stun, Root, or a powerful Slow. On a similar note, Stitches is a unique Hero who can also help you with that, given you are ready to cast Chastise right after Hook goes off, without waiting to see if it will hit or not, otherwise the projectile will end up being late.\n\nThe utility that Anduin offers with Leap of Faith can help allied Heroes who lack mobility (such as Raynor) to get away from danger or even enable more aggressive plays from Heroes that lack escape tools (for example Diablo, to save his Souls).\n\nYou can pair Lightbomb with a lot of Abilities (for example Wind Rush by Thrall) to execute powerful and quick engages that the enemy team will struggle to play against or simply use it as a follow-up to other crowd control effects (such as Blessed Shield by Johanna)."
  },
