        "id": "stukov",
        "name": "Stukov"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Anduin cannot rely on Leap of Faith to save allied Heroes from enemy Heroes that can engage multiple times per minute (for example E.T.C. with Powerslide).\n\nA strong dive Hero (such as Sonya) can heavily pressure Anduin, to the point that he will not be able to heal the rest of his team anymore, in addition to rendering Leap of Faith useless.\n\nPoke damage is annoying for Anduin because he lacks area of effect sustain healing to keep everyone healthy during prolonged team fights."
  },
